Package: JABBA3
Type: Package
Title: Bayesian State-Space Surplus Production Models in 'RTMB'
Version: 3.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Henning", "Winker", email = "henning.winker@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre")))
Description: The next generation of 'JABBA' (Just Another Bayesian Biomass
    Assessment), now with hyperdrive. Fits Bayesian state-space surplus
    production models in 'RTMB' in well under a second, so you can spend less
    time waiting for chains to converge and more time arguing about priors.
    Full posteriors are available through 'tmbstan' (NUTS) for those who still
    like their MCMC. Inputs and outputs follow 'FLR' conventions for use with
    'ggplotFL', 'FLRef' and 'mse', and helpers convert classic 'JABBA' inputs
    so old scripts survive the jump to hyperspace.
